"text":"செலவு","lemma":"செலவு","gloss":"march/movement"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of/like"}],"gloss":"of the march"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செருமிகு","parts":[{"text":"செரு","lemma":"செரு","gloss":"battle"},{"text":"மிகு","lemma":"மிகு","gloss":"abundant"}],"gloss":"battle-abundant"},{"surface":"வளவ","parts":[{"text":"வளவ","lemma":"வளவன்","gloss":"O Chola king!"}],"gloss":"O Chola king!"},{"surface":"நிற்","parts":[{"text":"நிற்","lemma":"நிற்","gloss":"at you"}],"gloss":"at you","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சினைஇயோர்","parts":[{"text":"சினைஇயோர்","lemma":"சினையோர்","gloss":"those who are angry"}],"gloss":"those who are angry"},{"surface":"நாடே","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"country"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the country indeed"}]}],"literal":"Even the god of death looks for the right time, but without looking / so that the noble ones of the army crowded with spears perish / O king of winning battles who destroys at the desired place! / In all the eight directions, meteors fall / and on the great trees without leaves, the long branches wither and dry up / and the hot-rayed sun scorches, and other things / fearful bird voices sound / and teeth fall to the ground, and they bathe in oil / and they ride on male elephants, and they discard black garments / and the silver strong-legged thrones overturn / seeing in waking life such rare things of dreams / O strong one who makes war! looking at the manner of your coming / they are in a state of confusion, having unprotected abodes / kissing the flower-like eyes of their children, to their wives / along with the sorrowful people who yield grief / they have experienced great agitation, indeed, like the wind / with a march like fire raging / O Valavan of great battles! the country of those who were angry with you.","translation":"Even the god of death waits for the right time, but you, O king of victorious battles, destroy the noble warriors of spear-crowded armies at any place you desire, without waiting! In all eight directions, meteors fall; the long branches of leafless great trees wither and dry up; the hot-rayed sun scorches; fearful birds screech; teeth fall to the ground; they dream of bathing in oil, riding elephants, discarding black garments, and seeing their silver thrones overturn. Seeing in waking life these terrible things usually seen only in dreams, and anticipating your arrival, O warrior of battles, those who were angry with you are filled with confusion in their unprotected homes. Kissing the flower-like eyes of their children, they and their grieving people weep with their wives. O Valavan of great battles! Your march is like fire raging with the wind, and the country of your enemies has indeed suffered immense agitation and ruin.","modern":"கூற்றுவனும் கூடத் தகுந்த காலத்தை எதிர்பார்ப்பான். ஆனால், வேல் ஏந்திய படைகளைக் கொண்ட சிறந்த வீரர்கள் அழியும்படி, தான் விரும்பிய இடத்திலேயே உடனே அழிக்கும் வெற்றிப் போர் புரியும் வேந்தனே! எட்டுத் திசைகளிலும் எரிகற்கள் விழுகின்றன. பெரிய மரங்களின் இலைகளற்ற நீண்ட கிளைகள் காய்ந்து பற்றுகின்றன. வெப்பக் கதிர்களை உடைய சூரியன் சுட்டெரிக்கிறான். அஞ்சத்தக்க பறவைகளின் குரல்கள் ஒலிக்கின்றன. பற்கள் நிலத்தில் விழுகின்றன; எண்ணெயில் மூழ்குவது போலவும், யானை மேல் ஏறுவது போலவும், கரிய ஆடையை நீக்குவது போலவும், வெள்ளி மயமான அரியணை கவிழ்வது போலவும் கனவில் தோன்றும் தீய நிமித்தங்களை நனவிலும் காண்கின்றனர். போர் செய்யும் வலிமை மிக்கவனே! உனது வருகையை எண்ணி, உன்னை எதிர்த்த பகைவர்கள் பாதுகாப்பு இல்லாத தம் இருப்பிடங்களில் கலக்கமடைந்துள்ளனர். தம் பிள்ளைகளின் மலர் போன்ற கண்களை முத்தமிட்டு, தம் மனைவியரோடும் துன்பம் தரும் எளிய மக்களோடும் அழுது வருந்துகின்றனர். போர் மிகுந்த வளவனே! காற்றோடு கூடிய நெருப்புப் பரவுவது போன்ற உனது படையெடுப்பால், உன்னை எதிர்த்த பகைவர்களின் நாடு மிகப்பெரிய அழிவையும் கலக்கத்தையும் அடைந்துள்ளது.","explanation":"The poet Kovur Kizhar addresses the Chola king Killivalavan, who is renowned for his fierce warfare. He describes the terrible bad omens appearing in the dreams and waking lives of the king's enemies. These omens include meteors falling in all eight directions, leafless branches of great trees drying up, the sun shining with scorching heat, birds making fearful sounds, teeth falling to the ground, bathing in oil, riding on elephants, discarding black garments, and silver thrones/beds overturning. Seeing these terrifying omens, the enemies' families are filled with distress, kissing their children and weeping. The poet compares the king's march to a fire raging with the wind, bringing immense agitation and destruction to the lands of those who dared to be angry with him.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,2.4],[2.4,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,4.22],[4.22,4.5],[4.5,5.5],[5.5,5.8],[5.8,6.8],[6.8,7.5],[7.5,7.6],[7.6,7.6],[7.6,9.7],[9.7,10.0],[10.0,10.3],[10.3,10.6],[10.6,11.0],[11.0,12.5],[12.5,12.8],[12.8,13.2],[13.2,13.6],[14.66,14.84],[14.84,15.22],[15.22,15.7],[15.98,16.67],[16.67,16.81],[16.95,17.5],[17.5,18.0],[18.0,18.2],[19.08,19.78],[19.78,20.28],[20.28,20.48],[20.55,21.08],[21.08,22.23],[22.43,22.62],[22.62,22.81],[22.81,23.39],[23.58,24.38],[24.38,24.58],[24.58,24.98],[24.98,25.18],[25.18,25.46],[26.28,26.61],[26.68,26.81],[26.85,26.88],[26.88,27.88],[27.88,29.08],[29.08,29.38],[29.51,29.58],[29.58,30.2],[30.28,31.28],[31.28,31.48],[31.48,31.78],[31.78,32.48],[32.48,32.48],[32.48,33.98],[34.02,34.2],[34.2,34.28],[34.28,35.3],[35.3,36.18],[36.18,36.98],[36.98,37.18],[38.24,39.04],[39.04,39.34],[39.34,39.74],[39.74,40.44],[40.44,40.54],[40.54,40.76],[40.88,41.44],[41.44,41.74]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.9],[1.9,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,3.8],[3.8,4.3],[4.3,6.02],[6.02,6.6],[6.6,7.3],[7.3,7.8],[7.8,8.35],[8.9,9.5],[9.6,9.9],[9.9,10.0],[10.0,11.45],[11.7,12.1],[12.1,12.4],[12.4,12.8],[12.8,13.2],[13.2,13.52],[13.52,13.52],[13.52,16.1],[17.43,19.2],[19.57,19.93],[19.93,19.93],[19.93,19.93],[19.93,19.93],[19.93,20.5],[20.5,21.0],[21.0,21.1],[21.1,21.7],[22.76